#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:254
#: 2fb46cfebe42451a8f468c0c4bcfe1d7
msgid "Or, this can be achieved by slightly lengthening the one element ( becomes more inductive) and shortening the other( becomes more capacitive) - this also introduces the required phase difference between the elements."
