#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:262
#: 00fdd3d685c44df78ec15ae6a42841b2
msgid "One short and one long element penetrate the outer tube and are connected to the inner tube."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:264
