#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:277
#: ce4a519fa4414df580b035d6a13a1cb3
msgid "Typically this would be measured on a network analyser and the feed impedance of each element set to say R+j45 ohms ( longer dipole) and the other to R-j45 ohms."
